{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:40:43Z","created_by_operation":"op_44a6a001fe7a462282e4554df8161323","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_2626bd94a913d3340e717fb2be2fb07f3da599b23548c19a6f450588749b9d2d","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"choiyounggi/cliclaw@6a5e048a5abf snapshot 16445cc7ff31dba2","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_ac1a01190b63cb9a96126e179ca4f8e30c3578bf621fb3494976a2758d4e20cf"],"source_ids":["src_bfaea1dfaee85600b41702717a047e68"],"text":"Secrets written to bot.log/bot.err are pre-redacted, covering Telegram bot tokens, npm tokens, GitHub PATs, and exact matches of the live config token.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:40:43Z","updated_by_operation":"op_44a6a001fe7a462282e4554df8161323"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:40:43Z","created_by_operation":"op_44a6a001fe7a462282e4554df8161323","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_4661b5a785b967c259542fdcbe3f7eab9697708fdf9928ded1b0dc0ba38f40e7","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=workflows","setting":"choiyounggi/cliclaw@6a5e048a5abf snapshot 16445cc7ff31dba2","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_06ad3e358d9284d75de43678d6c56b7652229b198bd71c9d5f612f5cf6245c19","slc_88d7e598c71d27f50782c84ecfa5c23197b7eec01e7ee30b65fdec89c5982c82"],"source_ids":["src_e429e947d2345c1c98f6383c1677d2d5"],"text":"Repository development practice: contributors must pass bun test (222+ cases) and tsc --noEmit, add unit tests for new features, discuss changes over 30 lines via issue/RFC first, and PRs are validated by a GitHub Actions Test workflow on macOS-latest.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:40:43Z","updated_by_operation":"op_44a6a001fe7a462282e4554df8161323"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:40:43Z","created_by_operation":"op_44a6a001fe7a462282e4554df8161323","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_4d70ba6a4833b67b5c534f24b6c670bf0f3c1c0c507d7d1e55be5ab25eaefcc8","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=tools-permissions","setting":"choiyounggi/cliclaw@6a5e048a5abf snapshot 16445cc7ff31dba2","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_a47ddd48af58cf013b7b778d6da626825d755a8640bc8e84c4a54ec9f7934372"],"source_ids":["src_bfaea1dfaee85600b41702717a047e68"],"text":"Safety mode (on by default) re-confirms dangerous Bash commands via Telegram inline Allow/Deny buttons, auto-denies on no response, and denies Claude reads of sensitive files like ~/.ssh and .env; custom regexes can be added.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:40:43Z","updated_by_operation":"op_44a6a001fe7a462282e4554df8161323"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:40:43Z","created_by_operation":"op_44a6a001fe7a462282e4554df8161323","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_55ea977c16de5557918064215e91782372e37ac200758c90d22974476d25a55c","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=workflows","setting":"choiyounggi/cliclaw@6a5e048a5abf snapshot 16445cc7ff31dba2","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_ae9ccdcc7053ba052cc6a7bbe73f6ddbddec84db1ea3be4954cf763ade567323"],"source_ids":["src_e429e947d2345c1c98f6383c1677d2d5"],"text":"Repository development practice: coding conventions require Bun 1.x runtime with zero runtime dependencies (devDeps only), strict TypeScript, lib/<feature>.ts module separation, vitest-API tests in __tests__/, and no direct console.log.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:40:43Z","updated_by_operation":"op_44a6a001fe7a462282e4554df8161323"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:40:43Z","created_by_operation":"op_44a6a001fe7a462282e4554df8161323","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_6b0f6bfd8f09cffcf262b1cdfd8c96dcedfa65f4ca9c8ddfb420e2c012e49244","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=dependencies","setting":"choiyounggi/cliclaw@6a5e048a5abf snapshot 16445cc7ff31dba2","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_486f77987ca8b1fdbf2cfdaac7c83970c56345f81622d11bb01d8740b8395488","slc_8fb1200897be5304584279877a377e181509fb16d7c9e2b6901074a693f7b971","slc_d97bee8091ab331d8af181db3f785ea082aae62749b0d8c527074eb4e05cd1d3"],"source_ids":["src_bfaea1dfaee85600b41702717a047e68"],"text":"The product requires Bun 1.x on macOS and at least one installed, authenticated coding CLI; it spawns those CLIs as child processes and is published as the npm package @younggichoi/cliclaw.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:40:43Z","updated_by_operation":"op_44a6a001fe7a462282e4554df8161323"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:40:43Z","created_by_operation":"op_44a6a001fe7a462282e4554df8161323","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_81c31614b9fb5fb724525e934646fdde8bf6d8b02f40600a922824656463243c","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"choiyounggi/cliclaw@6a5e048a5abf snapshot 16445cc7ff31dba2","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_8e30bc0553a741e75050c3f5c79f810a9ca977113664d57c981fd0924689edc2"],"source_ids":["src_bfaea1dfaee85600b41702717a047e68"],"text":"The product exposes CLI commands including init, start, install-launchd, uninstall-launchd, upgrade, version, logs (--audit/--err), doctor, and help.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:40:43Z","updated_by_operation":"op_44a6a001fe7a462282e4554df8161323"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:40:43Z","created_by_operation":"op_44a6a001fe7a462282e4554df8161323","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_8524e624e31fdec7c73db44fe6d1b8179fc6367680ca86064c133ed74d9177a9","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=orchestration","setting":"choiyounggi/cliclaw@6a5e048a5abf snapshot 16445cc7ff31dba2","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_dc02850f1370566ef17904cdab3ff24efa76a69050faddd8046a800627f4e8bd"],"source_ids":["src_bfaea1dfaee85600b41702717a047e68"],"text":"The daemon is built for unattended operation: single-instance lock, dormant retry every 60s on broken config instead of crash looping, graceful shutdown notifying chats, process-group kills on /stop, and retention sweeps of stale uploads/sessions (default 30 days).","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:40:43Z","updated_by_operation":"op_44a6a001fe7a462282e4554df8161323"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:40:43Z","created_by_operation":"op_44a6a001fe7a462282e4554df8161323","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_85c5f9ad51568446521e5f03cb69d0c9719b7871fe9ec9a6bcb1725922d99a2a","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"choiyounggi/cliclaw@6a5e048a5abf snapshot 16445cc7ff31dba2","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_5c49645ed6d42f07320f0c563957cfb36f8deeebff0394fee4405d09a51dea01","slc_f315f0bbe54c8123010e5107bcd021deb8b0bc7a3cd439c11c25cd5de5583e81"],"source_ids":["src_bfaea1dfaee85600b41702717a047e68"],"text":"Agent paths are auto-discovered at startup in three passes (well-known dirs, newest nvm node's bin, login-shell PATH) with no absolute paths in config.json; undetected agents are skipped.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:40:43Z","updated_by_operation":"op_44a6a001fe7a462282e4554df8161323"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:40:43Z","created_by_operation":"op_44a6a001fe7a462282e4554df8161323","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_bad0c7b2c258d4ed4fd5e7b26ee6d8538f44048c537c6fe9eb58c6241c60201c","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=workflows","setting":"choiyounggi/cliclaw@6a5e048a5abf snapshot 16445cc7ff31dba2","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_7c3fc2b7c5eacb020244e7e0325f1cdf055930a68889f77bc55f14bc945cbb4e","slc_d8762aad13704971387b2c278d25aacb65fd67c19fe9e59cba9045a7d9063faa"],"source_ids":["src_bfaea1dfaee85600b41702717a047e68"],"text":"Repository development practice: releases are made by npm version bump, pushing tags, and publishing a GitHub release, which triggers publish.yml to npm publish after verifying the tag matches package.json version.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:40:43Z","updated_by_operation":"op_44a6a001fe7a462282e4554df8161323"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:40:43Z","created_by_operation":"op_44a6a001fe7a462282e4554df8161323","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_ce16b8dd6be5209e248cd85ecf067aaceb2c9648eca37e77aa3336e1031ecf1b","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=memory-state","setting":"choiyounggi/cliclaw@6a5e048a5abf snapshot 16445cc7ff31dba2","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_20d1d3223deb9ccac9dd1a62ca2fbb24fc965d5a7795b26246e7868a11015e6a","slc_6fafe34c76b3009e142d338395957eae9c96f7f2ac2d586c7d9c053af85a2867","slc_7b897c9231f48d044e47f83806c0acc9dcaebd74b0a16bb7add4ff0c8bc80e25"],"source_ids":["src_bfaea1dfaee85600b41702717a047e68"],"text":"All state lives under ~/.cliclaw/ (relocatable via CLICLAW_HOME): config.json, a bot.pid single-instance lock, safety.json, per-chat session metadata and per-agent session directories, logs, and a .sock confirm-gate IPC socket.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:40:43Z","updated_by_operation":"op_44a6a001fe7a462282e4554df8161323"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:40:43Z","created_by_operation":"op_44a6a001fe7a462282e4554df8161323","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_d509676e2b8a7e1886e59291c4a9515035cb36d0404d3bb6ea8422b035157bd6","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=tools-permissions","setting":"choiyounggi/cliclaw@6a5e048a5abf snapshot 16445cc7ff31dba2","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_2e7ea13c5090c0be821abe792644bc1cdc7e9c4e6016f5124199e9629c5e7fc3"],"source_ids":["src_bfaea1dfaee85600b41702717a047e68"],"text":"Per-agent headless policies: Claude runs with bypassPermissions (plan mode optional), Codex defaults to workspace-write sandbox, Pi uses default mode, and Gemini defaults to auto_edit approvalMode without confirm-gate integration.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:40:43Z","updated_by_operation":"op_44a6a001fe7a462282e4554df8161323"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:40:43Z","created_by_operation":"op_44a6a001fe7a462282e4554df8161323","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_ddf1ac5184967454f4261cf8e61e148a934ab6b3041f037512d3fb8f3766d1b1","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=limitations","setting":"choiyounggi/cliclaw@6a5e048a5abf snapshot 16445cc7ff31dba2","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_92fe7311b8b3d7a3fedba83dcec200de748d34edf703aaa95d061fed16b2c76d"],"source_ids":["src_bfaea1dfaee85600b41702717a047e68"],"text":"Documented limits: regex-based danger classification is imperfect, no body-text streaming for Codex/Pi/Gemini, Gemini lacks confirm-gate integration, photos only (no voice/files), one concurrent job per chat, 1:1 chats only, and macOS only.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:40:43Z","updated_by_operation":"op_44a6a001fe7a462282e4554df8161323"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:40:43Z","created_by_operation":"op_44a6a001fe7a462282e4554df8161323","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_ec9ec23e0b1fb679bb5705f9b9a5fe12c17002427d51c62a37defbeb7df2e047","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"choiyounggi/cliclaw@6a5e048a5abf snapshot 16445cc7ff31dba2","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_1d4a925e4f79a5a5d5808617498342d39a98b0ad8f23ff98d6b914abc6429b58"],"source_ids":["src_bfaea1dfaee85600b41702717a047e68"],"text":"In Telegram, slash commands switch the active agent, show status/health, stop jobs, reset sessions, toggle safety, set model overrides, and toggle Claude plan mode; other text or photos are sent as prompts.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:40:43Z","updated_by_operation":"op_44a6a001fe7a462282e4554df8161323"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:40:43Z","created_by_operation":"op_44a6a001fe7a462282e4554df8161323","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_f773ff00213ac273eabbc940dd3f09365ffb3721635ff6402d05c11660b67429","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=components","setting":"choiyounggi/cliclaw@6a5e048a5abf snapshot 16445cc7ff31dba2","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_245a8a470891f3b5864a764d9ff19f6c5d79a95e37c6f52fbfbfccc342a14d46"],"source_ids":["src_be0372be36b555218ade4fe880872536"],"text":"The codebase is organized as a bot.ts daemon entry point, a cli.ts entry point, and lib/ modules for audit logging, confirm IPC, danger patterns, launchd, streaming, rate limiting, and agent path resolution.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:40:43Z","updated_by_operation":"op_44a6a001fe7a462282e4554df8161323"}
